{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u300aHeroes Of Isekai\u300bis a roguelike auto-battler where you choose a hero, build an army, and strategize for battle. Develop your hero, manage a town, allocate resources, upgrade units, and recruit diverse races. Each hero has unique lore, skills, and talents, offering distinct strategic gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Choose Your Hero</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676290/extras/\u9009\u62e9\u4f60\u7684\u82f1\u96c4.png?t=1745246768\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We offer a variety of heroes, each with unique skills that drastically alter gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Races &amp; Units</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676290/extras/\u79cd\u65cf\u548c\u5175\u79cd.png?t=1745246768\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Slimes, Goblins, Beasts, and more...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Camp - Purchase &amp; Build</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676290/extras/\u8d2d\u4e70.png?t=1745246768\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Randomized pools offer buildings, spells, runes, and units. Spend gold each round to shape your hero and army\u2014choose your path.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Unique Buildings</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676290/extras/\u5efa\u7b51.png?t=1745246768\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Structures with special effects: amplify magic, forge hero gear, enhance unit stats, and more...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Magic System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spend mana to cast spells\u2014water, fire, earth, or wind, tiered from basic to advanced. Unleash lightning strikes, empower troops, or freeze enemies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Hero Equipment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gear up to boost stats\u2014time to go god-mode.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Rune System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676290/extras/\u7b26\u6587.png?t=1745246768\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Equip runes for multi-dimensional upgrades, a core build mechanic. Some grant instant bonuses; powerful ones require conditions to activate.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Hero Development</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676290/extras/\u5929\u8d4b2.png?t=1745246768\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Three core paths:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Army:</strong> Invest in units and runes. Hero talents/passives buff your forces.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Magic:</strong> Focus on spell-related buildings, runes, and gear. Talents amplify magic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Legend:</strong> Pour gold into smithing and power runes. Craft epic gear\u2014hero skills supercharge it.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Explore Perilous Maps</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick 1 of 3 nodes per move. Weigh risks vs rewards\u2014deeper zones bring tougher foes but greater loot. Push forward... until you face the Abyss Legion.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2676290?t=1745246768","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2676290?t=1745246768","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2676290/d843232c9ff1e94952cd4bd